  "_readme": "REFERENCE catalog of HTTP MCP connectors for Digital Marketing Pro. Copy any entry you want into .mcp.json under 'mcpServers' to enable it. .mcp.json is gitignored — fresh plugin installs get NO active MCPs by default, which keeps the install footprint clean. PLATFORM NOTE (May 2026): Plugin-bundled MCP servers auto-start when the plugin is enabled, so shipping nothing by default avoids forcing connection attempts and auth prompts on first install. COWORK COMPATIBILITY: All entries below are HTTP MCPs and work in both Claude Code CLI and Anthropic Cowork. Cowork does NOT support the stdio/npx MCPs in .mcp.json.example — for those services, use the aggregator MCPs (Pipedream, Composio, Zapier, Make.com) at the bottom of this file. Endpoints verified May 2026. TRANSPORT RE-CHECK 2026-10-04: MCP spec 2026-07-28 classifies the old HTTP+SSE transport as Deprecated (eligible for removal); asana, webflow and make-com were moved to their vendors' Streamable HTTP URLs, and replicate (vendor page still lists only /sse) carries a _transport_status flag. Entries marked _access read-write can change live ad/CRM accounts — DMP routes those writes through the typed approval gate and creates new ad objects PAUSED.",

