    "_section_official_ad_platform_mcps": "Ad-platform MCP servers published by the platforms themselves (checked 2026-10-04). Opt-in only — NEVER copy these into the shipped .mcp.json. DMP write policy for every entry that can write: writes run only behind the typed approval gate in /digital-marketing-pro:launch-ad-campaign (Execution Summary -> user types yes -> approval-manager.py create-approval -> execute -> mark-executed), and every NEW campaign / ad set / ad group / ad is created with status PAUSED, set explicitly in the tool call (do not rely on a server default). Activation is a separate, separately approved write.",
    "meta-ads": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://mcp.facebook.com/ads",
      "_auth": "Business-authenticated Meta login (OAuth) on first connect; write tools need an ad-account role that can manage ads. Business portfolio admins can set governance rules for AI app connections (16 Jul 2026 update).",
      "_access": "read-write",
      "_purpose": "Meta Ads AI Connectors (official, Meta-hosted). Per Meta: create and edit ads, ad sets and campaigns; reporting and insights; catalog creation and feed troubleshooting; signals/dataset health; A/B tests and conversion lift studies; activity logs.",
      "_write_policy": "Typed approval gate + PAUSED-by-default (see section note). A third-party write-up says Meta's tools create objects paused by default; Meta's own pages we opened do not state it, so DMP sets status PAUSED explicitly.",
      "_status": "open beta (announced 29 Apr 2026)",
      "_source": "https://www.facebook.com/business/news/meta-ads-ai-connectors ; https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/ads-commerce/ads-ai-connectors/ads-mcp-server/ads-mcp-server-overview",
      "_checked": "2026-10-04"
    },
