      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://<your-self-hosted-host>/mcp",
      "_auth": "OAuth 2.0 (Application Default Credentials, or OAuth client ID/secret when run behind its OAuth proxy) with the https://www.googleapis.com/auth/adwords scope; a Google Ads developer token is recommended for production access. Service accounts also supported per Google's guide.",
